[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5245679272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5245679272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5245679272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOKq2qA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-10T20:36:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T20:36:47Z","body":"> Ubuntu 20.04.6 LTS\n\nMost likely compiler is too old, toolchain used for official build use GCC 15.2.0.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5245679272/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5271753292","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5271753292","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5271753292,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOjiSTA","user":{"login":"EvanNibbe","id":61066889,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMDY2ODg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61066889?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe","html_url":"https://github.com/EvanNibbe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EvanNibbe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-12T19:23:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T19:23:55Z","body":"Okay, this is what I did to solve the problem (for reference for anyone in the future facing a similar problem):\n\nI burned the Ubuntu 26.04 LTS iso onto an 8 GB flash drive (using Linux Disks Utility).\n\nI turned off and rebooted my computer while pressing F12 to get to the boot menu and switch the priority for booting to be a flash drive.\n\nI followed the normal steps for setting up Ubuntu, including accepting the proprietary apps.\n\nThen, in the command line:\n\n```\nsudo apt install git\ngit clone https://github.com/godotengine/godot.git\ncd godot\nsudo apt install g++\nsudo apt install pkg-config\nscons target=editor platform=linuxbsd CXXFLAGS=-O3 use_lto=yes\n./bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64\n```\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5271753292/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291272543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5291272543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5291272543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO2JpXw","user":{"login":"ernzo","id":5151357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNTEzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5151357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo","html_url":"https://github.com/ernzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ernzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T08:36:08Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T08:36:08Z","body":"If anyone still runs into GCC issues, \nanother option could be building Godot with Clang/LLVM, and use Mold as the linker..\n\nscons platform=linuxbsd target=editor dev_build=no module_mono_enabled=no use_llvm=yes linker=mold -j$(nproc)\n\n This is what I use on Debian and has worked perfectly so far...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291272543/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291303354","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5291303354","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5291303354,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO2Lhug","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T08:39:44Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T08:39:44Z","body":"Closing as resolved by using the required compiler version","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291303354/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291404062","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5291404062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5291404062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO2RrHg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T08:51:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T08:51:39Z","body":"Since it is compiler version issue, we should update checks our SCons config to higher version (currently it seems to be >= 9 for GCC).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291404062/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291456980","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5291456980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5291456980,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO2U51A","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T08:57:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T08:57:50Z","body":"Does it happen without the explicit `-O3` flag? What specific version is your GCC?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291456980/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291897960","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5291897960","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5291897960,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO2v0aA","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T09:45:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T09:50:37Z","body":"I can reproduce the issue on an `ubuntu:20.04` docker container, which defaults to GCC 9. Note that Ubuntu 20.04 has too old a SCons and Python version by default. They provide `python3.9` as an option, and then SCons can be installed with `python3.9 -m pip install scons` and ran with `python3.9 -m SCons`.\n\nGodot first-party code does support GCC 9 still as far as I can see. What fails (as seen in the logs above and which I could confirm) is:\n- wayland-scanner generated files don't compile. Might be due to wayland-scanner being too old on Ubuntu 20.04 (`libwayland-dev` 1.18.0), or it generating code that requires a newer compiler (the latter seems unlikely since it's a GCC 9-era wayland-scanner version)\n- Jolt Physics seems to require a C++20 `__builtin_bit_cast` not supported in GCC 9 (which was implemented in GCC 11 and Clang 9 - according to a clanker sourcing it from a human here: https://reviews.llvm.org/D75960?id=371445#inline-1015620).\n\nI'm fine upping our min supported GCC version anyway as GCC 9 is really ancient (and there's no reason to make Godot builds on a distro as old as Ubuntu 20.04, even for portabiliity something like 22.04 is plenty enough - but the better option is to use our [buildroot](https://github.com/godotengine/buildroot/) on a recent distro). But technically it's still possible to build Godot as of current `master` with GCC 9 and `scons wayland=no module_jolt_physics_enabled=no`.\n\n*Edit:* The wayland XML validity errors don't seem to break the build actually, so it's just Jolt adding the limitation. Ubuntu 20.04 also provides `gcc-10` and I confirmed that it also fails compiling Jolt.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291897960/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291976130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5291976130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5291976130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO20lwg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T09:54:23Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T09:54:23Z","body":"FYI @jrouwe @mihe \n\nThere's no problem for us to up our min compiler requirement to GCC 11 (from 9) and Clang 9 (from 6), as this will happen sooner than later when we adopt C++20. But in case your ad-hoc non C++20 implementation of `BitCast` was meant to preserve support for older compilers, you might want to check it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5291976130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292076934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5292076934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5292076934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO26vhg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T10:05:40Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T10:33:46Z","body":"@Ivorforce For the record, it seems like this code trips up Clang < 12:\n```\n./servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h:73:66: error: member reference base type 'Span' is not a structure or union\n        static constexpr size_t MAX_RESOURCE_SIZE = Span(RESOURCE_SIZES).max();\n                                                    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~\n```\n\nOur current min supported version is Clang 6 according to our checks in SConstruct, but in practice 6-11 aren't usable anymore.\n\n---\n\n*Edit:* It appears to be a known class of bugs in Clang < 12, which can be worked around easily with:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h b/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h\nindex 103bd9976b..04e51472ee 100644\n--- a/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h\n+++ b/servers/rendering/rendering_device_driver.h\n@@ -70,7 +70,7 @@ class RenderingShaderContainerFormat;\n template <typename... RESOURCE_TYPES>\n struct VersatileResourceTemplate {\n \tstatic constexpr size_t RESOURCE_SIZES[] = { sizeof(RESOURCE_TYPES)... };\n-\tstatic constexpr size_t MAX_RESOURCE_SIZE = Span(RESOURCE_SIZES).max();\n+\tstatic constexpr size_t MAX_RESOURCE_SIZE = Span<size_t>(RESOURCE_SIZES).max();\n \tuint8_t data[MAX_RESOURCE_SIZE];\n \n \ttemplate <typename T>\n```\n\nThat makes current `master` compile with Clang 9+, and I could confirm Jolt also fails to compile its `__builtin_bit_cast` with Clang < 9:\n\n```\nIn file included from thirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Core/IssueReporting.cpp:5:\nIn file included from thirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Jolt.h:14:\nthirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Math/Math.h:243:28: error: 'To' does not refer to a value\n        return __builtin_bit_cast(To, inValue);\n                                  ^\nthirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Math/Math.h:238:17: note: declared here\ntemplate <class To, class From>\n                ^\nIn file included from thirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Core/IssueReporting.cpp:5:\nIn file included from thirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Jolt.h:17:\nIn file included from thirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Math/Real.h:7:\nthirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Math/DVec3.h:277:33: error: constexpr variable 'cTrue' must be initialized by a constant expression\n        inline static constexpr double  cTrue = BitCast<double>(~uint64(0));\n                                        ^       ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\nthirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Math/Math.h:244:1: note: control reached end of constexpr function\n}\n^\nthirdparty/jolt_physics/Jolt/Math/DVec3.h:277:41: note: in call to 'BitCast(~JPH::uint64(0))'\n        inline static constexpr double  cTrue = BitCast<double>(~uint64(0));\n                                                ^\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292076934/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292348128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5292348128","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5292348128,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABO3LS4A","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-14T10:37:10Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T10:43:59Z","body":"> which was implemented in GCC 11 and Clang 9 - according to a clanker sourcing it from a human\n\nIn case you want hard proof of the supported versions, it is indeed GCC 11 and Clang 9: https://godbolt.org/z/qfsj6av3x\n\nEDIT: The comment above was posted as I was typing this up, so I missed it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5292348128/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5381986338","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122283#issuecomment-5381986338","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122283","id":5381986338,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQMqYIg","user":{"login":"jrouwe","id":1621693,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjE2OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1621693?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe","html_url":"https://github.com/jrouwe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jrouwe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-22T18:40:26Z","updated_at":"2026-08-22T18:40:26Z","body":"> But in case your ad-hoc non C++20 implementation of BitCast was meant to preserve support for older compilers, you might want to check it.\n\nThe change was intentional and I knew this would bump the required compiler versions. I didn't realize that godot was still supporting gcc 9 though, will check next time. It made `BitCast` `constexpr` where the previous implementation was only `const`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5381986338/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]